  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a deep frying pan over medium heat to 170°C.",
    "Cut carrots, zucchini, bell peppers, and onions into 5cm sticks.",
    "In a shallow dish, mix together speculaas spice mix, rice flour, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Dip each vegetable stick into the rice flour mixture, coating evenly.",
    "Dip the coated vegetable stick into the beaten egg, making sure to coat completely.",
    "Deep-fry the coated vegetable sticks in batches until golden brown, about 4 minutes per side.",
    "Drain the fried kushikatsu on paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, honey, sesame seeds, and green onions.",
    "Transfer the fried kushikatsu to a serving plate and drizzle with the soy sauce glaze.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
